{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1131.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7c674d0d5bb467da372508a199931b42cce502ee933ba708a0ebfeed705808e0","ja":"うぅ、寒かったわね……年越しは日本の予定だった\nけど、今から暖かい国へ行こうかしら。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1131.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a4b411701a54614ef0948f280b1a3b2dde89eed86ca0fbd8082e9309df4d9021","ja":"ええっ！？　今からって、海外って\nそんなに気軽に行けるものなの……？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1131.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"339b2e818b8b5a0ca5b2c2167310f9814443f5e951b5290ebac819183ce785a7","ja":"でも、伊織ちゃんのことだから、\n思いついたときに行っちゃいそうね……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1131.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"507efef5a436c28135ef2587086575a3f3428a5561b65de01ce4566d7907ab11","ja":"ええ。砂浜で過ごす年越しも気持ちいいわよ。\nふたりはお休みはどう過ごすの？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1131.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"142383583e2827e210b2de251423fac47b8da9ddb08a1ed4291ac735ea5c953d","ja":"年末年始は自主レッスンのチャンスよ！\n私は歌って踊って、汗いっぱいで過ごすつもり！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1131.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8fb90d93a1363f380910580c67f760855c35e35d08326ab1416166be568f1847","ja":"私は、音大時代の友達からお泊まり会に誘われてるの。\nこの1年であったこと、いっぱい話そうって。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1131.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"cd532cee5198e0c00ba52d2d69752fdb66c1ec55e95c29d055c74f99237cd91f","ja":"ただ、まだ行けるかわからなくて……\n父に反対されてるから。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1131.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"e3c880ea24ee2db47925530c1e8ea432a741a46511b17cddad2f5162a58b362e","ja":"えっ！　どうして？","zh":"咦！为什么？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1131.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"924ee7aa3a45d08257f170922b5909b987c4ddc494c399a46fe5692a4e068d7e","ja":"それが、「年末年始は家族で過ごすべきだ」って、\n聞かなくて。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1131.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"06c3144f9c16d65cfa8448dd257be37c1f2fdbb3c95350cda6dc656e79d4a989","ja":"そうなんですか……せっかくのお泊り会なのに、\nキャンセルするのは寂しいですよね……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1131.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"cea0cdd72ff84695e4d033fd0c11a98210ae744d70dc586fc49475bdc5b47b22","ja":"ほんとよね！　それに親に言われたからって、\n素直に諦めるのも、なんだかすっきりしないし……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1131.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e340f3af7cba6b4d4570674508d79c23baf8a2b32a5f4194d33cd9e1417332fb","ja":"こうなったら作戦会議よ！\nお泊り会を実現させるにはどうするか考えましょう！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
